#. type: Title #
#: tools/componentcategories-sync/README.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Component Categories Sync"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: tools/componentcategories-sync/README.md:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Keeps `_data/componentcategories.yaml` current: for every component of the Quarkus platform (each platform extension,\n"
"and every artifact one of them brings in), which **Quarkus platform extension categories** it belongs to, and whether it\n"
"is one of Quarkus's own artifacts or a third-party dependency.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: tools/componentcategories-sync/README.md:7
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "What it does"
msgstr "機能の説明"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: tools/componentcategories-sync/README.md:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Asks the [Quarkus registry](https://registry.quarkus.io) for the recommended platform release, as `quarkus create`\n"
"does, unless a version is given.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: tools/componentcategories-sync/README.md:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Reads that release's **platform descriptor** (`io.quarkus.platform:quarkus-bom-quarkus-platform-descriptor`) with\n"
"Quarkus's own registry client (`PlatformDescriptor.java`), as the Quarkus tooling and code.quarkus.io do. The\n"
"descriptor has only the platform BOM's own extensions (not those of member BOMs such as Camel), and the platform's\n"
"categories with their display names, in the platform's order.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: tools/componentcategories-sync/README.md:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Resolves the Maven dependency graph of each extension's runtime artifact (`DependencyGraph.java`, with the same\n"
"resolver Quarkus uses: compile and runtime scopes, optional dependencies not followed). The first run downloads\n"
"many POMs.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: tools/componentcategories-sync/README.md:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Assigns categories (`CategoryAssignment.java`):\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#: tools/componentcategories-sync/README.md:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "a component that is itself a platform extension has that extension's categories;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#: tools/componentcategories-sync/README.md:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"anything else (a library, or a Quarkus module that is not an extension) has the categories of the platform\n"
"extensions whose dependencies include it;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#: tools/componentcategories-sync/README.md:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "a library brought in by extensions of **3 or more categories** is used all over the platform, so it is `core`;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#: tools/componentcategories-sync/README.md:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"a component with no categories (an extension without any, or a library only such extensions bring in) is\n"
"`miscellaneous`.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: tools/componentcategories-sync/README.md:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Writes the file, if it changed. Components are in alphabetical order and nothing in it changes between runs unless\n"
"something real did.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: tools/componentcategories-sync/README.md:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "The data"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: tools/componentcategories-sync/README.md:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"platform: 3.40.1.2             # the platform version it was worked out from\n"
"categories:                    # every category some component has, in the platform's order, with the platform's names\n"
"  - id: web\n"
"    name: Web\n"
"components:\n"
"  org.postgresql:postgresql:   # artifacts in group io.quarkus are named without it\n"
"    origin: third-party        # quarkus (group io.quarkus or under it, such as io.quarkus.arc) | third-party\n"
"    categories: [data]\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: tools/componentcategories-sync/README.md:43
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The extensions that bring each component in (the evidence for its categories) are not written, since nothing uses them\n"
"and they made up most of the file. `CategoryAssignment` works them out, so they could come back if needed.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: tools/componentcategories-sync/README.md:48
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The file is typed with the website's own class, `ComponentCategories` (a Roq data mapping, so the site reads it as a\n"
"bean), which the script compiles with `//SOURCES ../../src/main/java/io/quarkusio/categories/ComponentCategories.java`.\n"
"`DataMapping.java` is a compile-only stand-in for Roq's `@DataMapping` annotation; it goes away with\n"
"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkusio.github.io/pull/3251.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: tools/componentcategories-sync/README.md:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "`ComponentCategoriesDataTest` checks the file as the site reads it.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: tools/componentcategories-sync/README.md:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tests"
msgstr "テスト"

#. type: Plain text
#: tools/componentcategories-sync/README.md:55
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The category rules and the descriptor reader are tested without network access. The descriptor test reads\n"
"`test/platform-descriptor.json`, a **made-up** descriptor in the platform's shape (fake extensions, fake version 99.0.0):\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: tools/componentcategories-sync/README.md:56
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cd tools/componentcategories-sync\n"
"jbang CategoryAssignmentTest.java\n"
"jbang PlatformDescriptorTest.java\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: tools/componentcategories-sync/README.md:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "Running locally"
msgstr "ローカルでの実行"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: tools/componentcategories-sync/README.md:64
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"jbang tools/componentcategories-sync/main.java\n"
"git diff _data/componentcategories.yaml\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: tools/componentcategories-sync/README.md:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "CI"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: tools/componentcategories-sync/README.md:74
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`.github/workflows/sync-componentcategories.yml` runs weekly and on demand, and commits the file if it changed. On PRs\n"
"that touch the tool, `ComponentCategories` or the workflow, it runs the tests and the sync, and shows what would change\n"
"without committing.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: tools/componentcategories-sync/README.md:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "Options and environment variables"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: tools/componentcategories-sync/README.md:78
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--output` / `COMPONENTCATEGORIES_OUTPUT` - the file to write (default `_data/componentcategories.yaml`)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: tools/componentcategories-sync/README.md:78
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--platform` / `PLATFORM_VERSION` - the platform version (default the registry's recommended release)\n"
msgstr ""
